@startuml state-claim
title Claim – state machine (one phone's attempt to be one roster name)
hide empty description

[*] --> remote : join(mode=remote)
[*] --> pending_barcode : join(mode=in_class)\n[IP in campus ranges]
[*] --> [*] : join(in_class)\n[off campus] / 403

pending_barcode --> needs_area : submit_barcode\n[IP on campus AND >=5 live codes, 2 s]
pending_barcode --> pending_barcode : qr_static / qr_short /\nqr_stale / qr_replay
needs_area --> present : choose_area(zone)

remote --> flagged_remote : same name verified in class\nor picked remotely again
needs_area --> repick : another verified in-class\nclaim on the same name
present --> repick : another verified in-class\nclaim on the same name
repick --> present : repick(other free name)
repick --> lecturer_code : repick(same name again)\n/ one-time code on the lecturer dashboard
lecturer_code --> present : submit_code(correct)\n[typed on this phone by the lecturer]
lecturer_code --> lecturer_code : wrong code / code renewed
lecturer_code --> rejected : code typed on the other phone /\nlecturer reject

flagged_remote --> remote : lecturer accept
flagged_remote --> rejected : lecturer reject

note right of lecturer_code
  The lecturer walks to the real
  student and types the code there
end note
present : ✓ in class
remote : ✓ remote
rejected : may start over\nwith another name
rejected --> [*]
@enduml
